  "description": "Defines what constitutes a high-resolution archaeological scan based on quantitative parameters.",
  "definition": "A scan with ScanResolMm \\leq 1.0 and PointDense \\geq 1000, allowing for sub-millimeter precision in archaeological documentation and feature detection."
